--- !u!114 &263480131
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 263480127}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 49b7791878d846647b02ca388b8fcccf, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CutsceneSubtitles
  captions:
  - start: 1.5
    end: 8.345855
    text: A long time ago, Asher, our world wasn't just scrap metal and toxic dust.
  - start: 8.345855
    end: 17.817516
    text: It was covered in living things called trees, rolling green grass, and
      an endless, spotless blue sky.
  - start: 17.817516
    end: 27.289177
    text: Humanity built wonders back then - cities that touched the clouds, and
      machines with brilliant minds.
  - start: 27.289177
    end: 33.89102
    text: Everyone believed we stood at the absolute pinnacle of creation.
  - start: 34.19102
    end: 37.847347
    text: Then why did all those tall buildings fall down, Mom?
  - start: 38.147346
    end: 41.721375
    text: Because progress came at the cost of greed.
  - start: 41.721375
    end: 45.960335
    text: Once humans had everything, their hunger only grew.
  - start: 45.960335
    end: 50.365532
    text: They consumed this world until it was hollow and dry.
  - start: 50.365532
    end: 56.765533
    text: The creators chose to destroy their own creations out of sheer selfishness...
  - start: 56.765533
    end: 62.518776
    text: leaving behind a dying world. Just like the one you see today.
  - start: 62.818775
    end: 67.20653
    text: Is the world really going to die? Can we never save it?
  - start: 67.50653
    end: 70.84617
    text: We can, sweetheart. I truly believe that.
  - start: 70.84617
    end: 76.54799
    text: As long as a single fragment of nature survives somewhere out there...
  - start: 76.54799
    end: 82.982895
    text: remember this, Asher. Hope... no matter how fragile it seems... is always
      hope.
  - start: 82.982895
    end: 86.02653
    text: Go to sleep now, my brave boy.
--- !u!114 &263480132
